{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/b88a3afabe813912a8f08d9cc7abcdec.webp?t=1755827290\" width=615 height=45 /></span>Explore Wacambria Island\u2019s vast landscape as a treasure hunter, adventurer all while fighting valiantly for the freedom of the local islanders. Search various biomes, caves, ruins and towns while unlocking treasures and solving puzzles in your quest to liberate the island.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore an Ancient World</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/05e32cd7ae5aab5b1570971c016d4d07.webp?t=1755827290\" width=615 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/00ebd228d7d879a142d4bc571a9ca7ff.poster.avif?t=1755827290\" width=614 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/00ebd228d7d879a142d4bc571a9ca7ff.webm?t=1755827290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/00ebd228d7d879a142d4bc571a9ca7ff.mp4?t=1755827290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Discover the secret of Wacambria Island as you explore various locations including ruins, caves, temples and towns. Wacambria Island is packed with secrets, treasure and danger.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engage in Exciting Combat</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/05e32cd7ae5aab5b1570971c016d4d07.webp?t=1755827290\" width=615 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/3f6c703d210f5dab32d81d0876ede947.poster.avif?t=1755827290\" width=614 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/3f6c703d210f5dab32d81d0876ede947.webm?t=1755827290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/3f6c703d210f5dab32d81d0876ede947.mp4?t=1755827290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Engage in satisfying combat as you save Wacambria Island. Your enemies will strafe, parry and work together to try and stop your valiant efforts. Utilize the variety of weapons and tactics to bring your foes to their knees.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your adventurer</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/05e32cd7ae5aab5b1570971c016d4d07.webp?t=1755827290\" width=615 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/7adadf7cc3d8b26d1ffa12095625f4be.poster.avif?t=1755827290\" width=614 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/7adadf7cc3d8b26d1ffa12095625f4be.webm?t=1755827290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/7adadf7cc3d8b26d1ffa12095625f4be.mp4?t=1755827290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unlock new cosmetics and armor all throughout Wacambria and its various ruins and caves.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/263e6d8505a7a7045eda5000c0d0cf8b.webp?t=1755827290\" width=615 height=50 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the Locals</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/05e32cd7ae5aab5b1570971c016d4d07.webp?t=1755827290\" width=615 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/1d3cf301ea50cb0b628969d42610ad95.avif?t=1755827290\" width=614 height=180 /></span><br>Befriend the locals as you rise to the challenge of securing their freedom. The people of Wacambria Island are a friendly bunch. As you adventure through the Island you have the opportunity to engage and help them help you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buy and Decorate Your Home</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/05e32cd7ae5aab5b1570971c016d4d07.webp?t=1755827290\" width=615 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/66081d4c051c504979e5a30d6acf5a56.avif?t=1755827290\" width=614 height=180 /></span><br>Purchase one of many in game homes and decorate them to your hearts extent. Buy materials or use items you find on your adventure to create your own lavish living quarters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wacambria Island</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/05e32cd7ae5aab5b1570971c016d4d07.webp?t=1755827290\" width=615 height=5 /></span><br>Wacambria Island is a open-world, action RPG set on an island comprised of diverse biomes. Play as an adventurer whos search for treasure lands him in the middle of a drama between the local islanders and an invading army. With the island mostly controlled by the invading army, you will need to work together with the locals to gain back territory. This journey will take you across numerous biomes, caves, ruins and towns while discovering the secrets of an ancient power and a legendary hero. With the odds stacked against the local people, you will be the deciding factor of freedom in Wacambria Island.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1842680?t=1755827290","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1842680?t=1755827290","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/57a2d20d26f25df503e1d40822ac4efa627480e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755827290","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/57a2d20d26f25df503e1d40822ac4efa627480e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755827290","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/b88a3afabe813912a8f08d9cc7abcdec.webp?t=1755827290\" width=615 height=45 /></span>Explore Wacambria Island\u2019s vast landscape as a treasure hunter, adventurer all while fighting valiantly for the freedom of the local islanders. Search various biomes, caves, ruins and towns while unlocking treasures and solving puzzles in your quest to liberate the island.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore an Ancient World</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/05e32cd7ae5aab5b1570971c016d4d07.webp?t=1755827290\" width=615 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co